  "id": "mirror-drawing",
  "term": "mirror drawing",
  "definition": "Mirror drawing is a motor learning task used to assess and practice eye-hand coordination. It serves as a testbed for studying how learned motor skills are acquired under different conditions and can be carried out in either real-world or virtual reality settings.",
